<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Nam Pei Hong shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Nam Pei Hong shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Chinese medicine and health food retailer and manufacturer Nam Pei Hong (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Nam Pei Hong ended unchanged at HK$0.46 per share on Friday with 1.02 million shares changed hand.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
